  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2022 funding-democracy strength-Zambia(DSZ)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the Democracy Strengthening in Zambia project is to ensure that Zambia has strengthened democracy through functional and inclusive electoral processes that secure the peaceful conduct of elections and demonstrate heightened legitimacy and institutionalization of the multiparty system. The project aims at strengthening the institutional capacity of key electoral stakeholders to ensure procedural certainty and strengthening the legitimacy of the electoral process based on the Electoral Cycle Approach.</narrative>
  </description>
